# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Basics of Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-"
"estimation-qpe}"
msgstr ""
"3. Bazele Estimării Fazei Cuantice (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-"
"estimation-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given a unitary operation $U$, the QPE estimates $\\theta$ in $U\\vert\\psi "
"\\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ since $U$ is "
"unitary, all of its eigenvalues have a norm of 1.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dat fiind o operație unitară $U$, QPE estimează $\\theta$ în $U\\vert\\psi "
"\\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, deoarece $U$ "
"este unitar, toate valorile sale proprii au norma 1.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.1 Procedure {#31-procedure}"
msgstr "3.1 Procedură {#31-procedure}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup {#1-setup}"
msgstr "1. Configurare {#1-setup}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is in one set of qubit registers. An additional set of"
" $n$ qubits form the counting register on which we will store the value "
"$2^n\\theta$:\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ se află într-un set de registre de qubiți. Un set "
"suplimentar de $n$ qubiți formează registrul de numărare în care vom stoca "
"valoarea $2^n\\theta$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"
msgstr "2. Suprapunere {#2-superposition}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Apply a $n$-bit Hadamard gate operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ on the counting "
"register:\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplică o operație Hadamard de $n$ biți $H^{\\otimes n}$ pe registrul de "
"numărare:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Controlled Unitary operations {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"
msgstr "3. Operații unitare controlate {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We need to introduce the controlled unitary $CU$ that applies the unitary "
"operator $U$ on the target register only if its corresponding control bit is"
" $|1\\rangle$. Since $U$ is a unitary operator with eigenvector "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ such that $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} "
"\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, this means:\n"
msgstr ""
"Trebuie să introducem unitarul controlat $CU$ care aplică operatorul unitar "
"$U$ pe registrul țintă numai dacă bitul de control corespunzător este "
"$|1\\rangle$. Deoarece $U$ este un operator unitar cu eigenvectorul "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ astfel încât $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} "
"\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, aceasta înseamnă:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Example: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"
msgstr "3.2 Exemplu: QPE cu Gate-ul T {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's use $T$ gate as an example of QPE and estimate its phase $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Să folosim Gate-ul $T$ ca exemplu de QPE și să estimăm faza sa $\\theta$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
