msgstr "3.3 Exercițiu {#33-exercise}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimate $\\theta = 1/3$ using 3 qubits for counting and a qubit for an "
"eigenvector.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimează $\\theta = 1/3$ folosind 3 qubiți pentru numărare și un qubit "
"pentru un eigenvector.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. Since we want to implement "
"$U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$, we need to set "
"$\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"$P|1\\rangle = e^{i\\lambda}|1\\rangle$. Deoarece vrem să implementăm "
"$U|1\\rangle = e^{2\\pi i \\tfrac{1}{3}}|1\\rangle$, trebuie să setăm "
"$\\lambda = \\tfrac{2 \\pi}{3}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Solution of the exercise: $\\theta = 1/3$ {#solution-of-the-exercise-"
"theta-13}"
msgstr ""
"Soluția exercițiului: $\\theta = 1/3$ {#solution-of-the-exercise-theta-13}"

